From caead2f14be593901282daad7a9516fdf25c0dd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:21:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CB1: build the DV bridge against desktop OpenGL when Kodi
 uses it

Kodi's render API now decides which GL the bridge links. Desktop GL
builds include one header that maps the GLES extension names the bridge
uses to their core equivalents; GLES builds are unchanged.
